entries.intersection[2]='Actual Cartier restriction, effective order positivity and effective real decompositions are proved. Hartshorne I.6 actual curve-point/valuation bijection and order preservation are also proved. Finite/infinity prime classification and principal-sum transport, move/presentation-independent degree, real linearity and geometric relative ample positivity remain open.';
